# Features & User Stories — DonateNow

> Reference: [PRD.mdc](../../PRD.mdc) | [architecture.mdc](../architecture.mdc)

---

## F01: Donation Screen

**Location**: `DonationView.swift`

| Story ID | User Story | Acceptance Criteria |
|---|---|---|
| US-01.1 | As a donor, I want to read about the cause so I know why I should donate. | Cause title, description, and target amount are fetched from Supabase and displayed clearly. |
| US-01.2 | As a donor, I want to select predefined amounts (₹100, ₹500, etc.) to quickly choose my donation size. | Tapping a predefined amount pill highlights it and updates the total. |
| US-01.3 | As a donor, I want to enter a custom amount if I prefer a different size. | Tapping "Custom" shows a numeric keyboard. Validation ensures amount is between ₹1 and ₹1,00,000. |
| US-01.4 | As a donor, I must provide my name and email so the NGO can acknowledge me. | Form validates required fields (Name ≥ 2 chars, valid Email). "Donate Now" button is disabled if invalid. |
| US-01.5 | As a donor, I want the app to look great on my iPad. | View uses `maxWidth` to prevent form fields from stretching edge-to-edge on iPad. |

