## F02: Razorpay Payment Integration

**Location**: `PaymentService.swift`, Edge Functions

| Story ID | User Story | Acceptance Criteria |
|---|---|---|
| US-02.1 | As the system, I need to create a Razorpay order securely. | Tapping "Donate" calls `create-order` Edge Function, returning an `order_id` to the app. |
| US-02.2 | As a donor, I want a familiar payment interface. | App presents Razorpay native iOS SDK payment sheet. |
| US-02.3 | As the system, I need to securely verify the payment before recording it. | SDK success callback sends data to `verify-payment` Edge Function, which checks HMAC SHA256 signature and inserts DB record. |
| US-02.4 | As the system, I need to handle cases where the app is closed during payment. | Razorpay webhook (`payment.captured`) updates the DB status asynchronously. |

