## F03: Thank-You Screen

**Location**: `ThankYouView.swift`

| Story ID | User Story | Acceptance Criteria |
|---|---|---|
| US-03.1 | As a donor, I want immediate confirmation that my payment succeeded. | App navigates to `ThankYouView` automatically after Edge Function returns success. |
| US-03.2 | As a donor, I want to see my donation details. | Screen displays Amount, Name, Reference ID, and Date. |
| US-03.3 | As a donor, I want to return to the home screen. | "Done" or "Donate Again" button pops back to root of `NavigationStack`. |

---

## F04: Admin Authentication

**Location**: `AdminLoginView.swift`, `AuthService.swift`

| Story ID | User Story | Acceptance Criteria |
|---|---|---|
| US-04.1 | As an admin, I want to log in securely. | Email and password fields provided. Calls Supabase Auth to verify. |
| US-04.2 | As the system, I must protect admin routes. | Admin Dashboard cannot be accessed without a valid Supabase session. |
| US-04.3 | As an admin, I want to stay logged in. | Supabase SDK saves session to Keychain automatically. |
| US-04.4 | As an admin, I want to log out. | Logout button clears Keychain session and returns to login screen. |

---

## F05: Admin Dashboard

**Location**: `AdminDashboardView.swift`

| Story ID | User Story | Acceptance Criteria |
|---|---|---|
| US-05.1 | As an admin, I want to see the total number of donations. | Fetches aggregate count from Supabase securely. |
| US-05.2 | As an admin, I want to see the total amount raised. | Fetches aggregate sum from Supabase securely, formatted as INR. |
| US-05.3 | As an admin, I want to quickly access the full donor list. | Provides navigation link to `DonorLogView`. |

---

## F06: Donor Log

**Location**: `DonorLogView.swift`

| Story ID | User Story | Acceptance Criteria |
|---|---|---|
| US-06.1 | As an admin, I want to view a list of all donations. | Displays list of donations sorted by date (newest first). |
| US-06.2 | As an admin, I want to search for a specific donor. | Search bar filters the list by name or email locally or via Supabase query. |
| US-06.3 | As an admin, I want to filter by date. | Date picker filters the list to show only donations within that range. |
